OL,3,GNEWSATeddies and flowers left at scene
OL,4,Awhere six-year-old boy died in crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA six-year-old boy has died following a
OL,7,Fvan crash, police have said.
OL,9,FOfficers were called to reports of an
OL,10,Fincident involving a white Ford Transit
OL,11,FTipper and a child on Mill Road in
OL,12,FLlanfairfechan, Conwy county, after
OL,13,F17:00 BST on Thursday, where the child
OL,14,Fwas pronounced dead at the scene.
OL,16,FNorth Wales Police said a 39-year-old
OL,17,Fman had been arrested and later
OL,18,Freleased under investigation, while the
OL,19,Fboy's family was being supported by
OL,20,Fspecially trained family liaison
OL,21,Fofficers.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
